1
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:59,780
A little pause... and we are back.

2
00:01:24,360 --> 00:01:29,940
A little pause... and we are back.

3
00:01:29,941 --> 00:01:31,630
I commend all those
who have advanced to the

4
00:01:31,631 --> 00:01:34,181
finals for the third level
of the tuning exams.

5
00:01:34,679 --> 00:01:37,860
Well, there's one person missing,
but still, congratulations.

6
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:40,640
Sensei?

7
00:01:40,720 --> 00:01:41,720
Hmm?

8
00:01:43,044 --> 00:01:45,100
I have a question for you.

9
00:01:47,059 --> 00:01:48,059
About Sasuke?

10
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:50,280
I'm sorry.

11
00:01:50,699 --> 00:01:52,360
I don't know much about that, I'm afraid.

12
00:01:53,099 --> 00:01:55,140
But I wouldn't worry too much.

13
00:01:56,460 --> 00:01:59,380
From here on, it's up to you, Sasuke.

14
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:07,760
Sakura, I have to leave, so I'm counting
on you to get the details about the finals.

15
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:07,980
Huh?

16
00:02:08,415 --> 00:02:09,900
Oh, okay.

17
00:02:12,375 --> 00:02:17,660
Here, including the absent Sasuke,
we have five ninja from the Leaf Village.

18
00:02:19,140 --> 00:02:20,920
Three from the Sand Village.

19
00:02:22,100 --> 00:02:24,200
And one from the Sound Village.

20
00:02:25,580 --> 00:02:29,320
And now I will begin the explanation of
the final rounds.

21
00:02:30,290 --> 00:02:31,320
Well, it's about time.

22
00:02:38,940 --> 00:02:40,400
The preliminaries are done.

23
00:02:41,340 --> 00:02:42,860
They're moving on to the final rounds.

24
00:02:44,910 --> 00:02:48,860
While all these countries are busy racing
to expand their military might,

25
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:51,080
the birds are still singing.

26
00:02:52,390 --> 00:02:56,480
I believe that this country of ours has
been at peace for far, far too long.

27
00:02:58,940 --> 00:03:00,400
Then let me do it.

28
00:03:01,774 --> 00:03:02,520
Hmm.

29
00:03:02,521 --> 00:03:03,540
I don't know.

30
00:03:04,770 --> 00:03:08,280
How much fun would it be to take out an
old man like the Hokage, anyway?

31
00:03:08,860 --> 00:03:09,880
What's the problem?

32
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:13,220
You're not still having second thoughts
about it, are you, Orochimaru?

33
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:17,608
From now on, each of the
hidden villages will clash

34
00:03:17,609 --> 00:03:20,601
with each other in a
long and violent struggle.

35
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:24,540
Even the Sound Village won't escape that
violence.

36
00:03:26,920 --> 00:03:30,500
And it's your intention to be the trigger
for all that hostility.

37
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:33,160
By using Sasuke as a bullet?

38
00:03:33,630 --> 00:03:34,700
Isn't that correct?

39
00:03:36,260 --> 00:03:36,780
Hmm.

40
00:03:36,781 --> 00:03:38,340
You guess very well.

41
00:03:38,380 --> 00:03:40,420
So well that it's a bit creepy,
in fact.

42
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:45,260
The curse mark that was given to him
appears to have been sealed by Kakashi.

43
00:03:45,820 --> 00:03:48,060
But in any event, that is not my concern.

44
00:03:48,584 --> 00:03:52,660
While there is still some darkness left in
his heart, we must act.

45
00:03:53,860 --> 00:03:56,100
And that's why I want you to abduct him.

46
00:03:57,235 --> 00:03:59,800
It's unusual for you to act so hastily,
is it not?

47
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:01,360
Perhaps.

48
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:03,800
But there's still a little something
that's troubling me.

49
00:04:06,070 --> 00:04:07,340
Is it Naruto Uzumaki?

50
00:04:07,620 --> 00:04:08,000
Hmm.

51
00:04:08,320 --> 00:04:10,520
You're quite sharp, aren't you,
Kabuto?

52
00:04:11,260 --> 00:04:14,408
According to your
information, contact with that

53
00:04:14,409 --> 00:04:17,540
nine-tailed one has altered
Sasuke's heart and mind.

54
00:04:17,959 --> 00:04:22,320
So much so that Naruto now holds a certain
influence over our Sasuke.

55
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:25,820
The thing to do is to get Sasuke away from
him immediately.

56
00:04:27,020 --> 00:04:31,080
Because then... It will be so
easy to make him mine forever.

57
00:04:37,580 --> 00:04:38,580
Very well.

58
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:43,720
Hmm.

59
00:04:43,910 --> 00:04:44,920
That face...

60
00:04:45,470 --> 00:04:47,740
I wonder what's going on in his head.

61
00:04:49,060 --> 00:04:52,920
In the final rounds, each of you will put
your battle skills on display.

62
00:04:53,790 --> 00:04:55,708
You'll demonstrate the
power and control that

63
00:04:55,709 --> 00:04:58,441
you've achieved in your
respective disciplines.

64
00:05:00,265 --> 00:05:03,620
Accordingly, the final battles will
commence one month from now.

65
00:05:04,275 --> 00:05:06,320
Wait, we're not gonna do it right here and
now?

66
00:05:07,180 --> 00:05:09,800
This is to provide a suitable period of
preparation.

67
00:05:11,010 --> 00:05:12,010
What do you mean by that?

68
00:05:12,560 --> 00:05:13,560
Simply this.

69
00:05:13,765 --> 00:05:17,260
In addition to announcing the conclusion
of the preliminary matches to each

70
00:05:17,261 --> 00:05:20,530
country's leaders, we must
also have some time to prepare

71
00:05:20,531 --> 00:05:22,921
and distribute the summons
for the final selection.

72
00:05:23,540 --> 00:05:26,187
Not to mention that
you examinees are going

73
00:05:26,188 --> 00:05:27,980
to need time to prepare
for something else.

74
00:05:27,981 --> 00:05:29,176
Something that is this important.

75
00:05:29,200 --> 00:05:31,880
This old man sure likes to beat around the
bush.

76
00:05:32,580 --> 00:05:34,840
Look, I don't really get what you're
trying to say.

77
00:05:35,080 --> 00:05:36,140
What's the point of this?

78
00:05:36,740 --> 00:05:40,900
I mean that to know your adversaries and
prepare yourselves, you need time.

79
00:05:41,500 --> 00:05:44,800
Even though up to this point all the
battles have been real battles,

80
00:05:45,020 --> 00:05:48,108
as I'm sure you can all
attest, they were conducted on

81
00:05:48,109 --> 00:05:50,560
the premise that you were
fighting an unknown enemy.

82
00:05:50,780 --> 00:05:53,880
But that's no longer the case now that
you've battled each other.

83
00:05:55,020 --> 00:05:55,980
Yeah, seriously.

84
00:05:55,981 --> 00:06:00,020
I would never have dreamed that this guy
could turn sand into a weapon.

85
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:04,920
So in order to make the finals fair and
just, we're giving you this month,

86
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:09,000
each of you must embrace the opportunity
to practice hard and learn some new tricks.

87
00:06:09,640 --> 00:06:13,155
Because by now everyone here
knows your techniques, so using

88
00:06:13,156 --> 00:06:16,320
your old tired tricks is a
sure way to lose in the finals.

89
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:18,380
And remember to get some rest as well.

90
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:31,260
This isn't some vacation!

91
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:33,720
I won't have any time to relax!

92
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:36,080
I've got to train harder than ever!

93
00:06:44,350 --> 00:06:47,670
I suppose brilliance can sometimes have
its disadvantages.

94
00:06:48,715 --> 00:06:51,405
We failed to avoid
Orochimaru's watchful eye,

95
00:06:51,406 --> 00:06:55,211
and it's most
unfortunate for both of us.

96
00:06:55,810 --> 00:06:58,572
He's so young, but
the seeds of evil have

97
00:06:58,573 --> 00:07:02,271
already taken root just
waiting to be exploited.

98
00:07:02,580 --> 00:07:05,990
He'll be ripe for Orochimaru's special
ninjutsu.

99
00:07:20,850 --> 00:07:22,470
Well, well, Kakashi.

100
00:07:23,330 --> 00:07:26,210
Foiling my attack by striking from my
blind spot, huh?

101
00:07:27,010 --> 00:07:29,890
But now, are you ready to take me on?

102
00:07:30,570 --> 00:07:33,530
Next time you should station at least ten
guards.

103
00:07:35,370 --> 00:07:39,550
The Anbu Black Ops unit that I assembled
was defeated so easily.

104
00:07:40,850 --> 00:07:43,530
You... you're not an ordinary genin,
are you?

105
00:07:43,790 --> 00:07:47,010
You caught a whiff of me and immediately
readied your weapon.

106
00:07:47,330 --> 00:07:48,410
Quite impressive.

107
00:07:49,370 --> 00:07:50,810
You overestimate me.

108
00:07:51,910 --> 00:07:53,710
So what do you want with Sasuke?

109
00:07:53,970 --> 00:07:56,710
Finding you like this, I ought to haul you
in for questioning.

110
00:07:57,890 --> 00:07:59,130
What, just you?

111
00:07:59,710 --> 00:08:01,670
I wonder if you could.

112
00:08:02,610 --> 00:08:04,770
Are you looking to take me on?

113
00:08:06,070 --> 00:08:06,630
Yes, I am.

114
00:08:06,750 --> 00:08:10,430
I know who you are.

115
00:08:10,510 --> 00:08:12,730
You're the Leaf Medical Corps Chief's son.

116
00:08:13,190 --> 00:08:15,370
Your name... what was it?

117
00:08:15,710 --> 00:08:17,010
Kabuto Yakushi.

118
00:08:17,910 --> 00:08:20,530
What are you, one of Orochimaru's puppets?

119
00:08:20,850 --> 00:08:24,046
Even if you did take me
into custody, you'd never

120
00:08:24,047 --> 00:08:26,751
be able to prove I have
any connection to him.

121
00:08:26,810 --> 00:08:28,590
Just answer my question.

122
00:08:29,650 --> 00:08:31,190
And if I say no?

123
00:08:32,330 --> 00:08:34,169
I'm the one asking the questions.

124
00:08:34,170 --> 00:08:36,130
Now give me some answers.

125
00:08:36,549 --> 00:08:39,549
Look, you'll have your answers soon
enough, even if I'm not here.

126
00:08:40,130 --> 00:08:42,770
So why don't we skip the middleman and let
me go?

127
00:08:43,530 --> 00:08:45,730
You smart-alecky little brat.

128
00:08:46,810 --> 00:08:49,430
I'll teach you to mess around with
grown-ups.

129
00:08:50,290 --> 00:08:51,870
Come on, give me a break.

130
00:08:51,950 --> 00:08:53,030
Don't be so arrogant.

131
00:08:53,750 --> 00:08:56,230
The cards are clearly in my favor here.

132
00:09:06,730 --> 00:09:10,160
Let's go.

133
00:09:38,700 --> 00:09:41,100
I can't believe I let him escape.

134
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:47,520
I can't believe I let him escape.

135
00:09:47,521 --> 00:09:48,521
Impressive.

136
00:09:51,329 --> 00:09:56,980
Just as I suspected, the Dead Soul Jutsu,
where a ninja temporarily animates and

137
00:09:56,981 --> 00:10:00,460
controls a dead body, even transforming
its face.

138
00:10:01,079 --> 00:10:05,140
Kabuto even stopped his own heart and
eliminated all traces of his scent in

139
00:10:05,141 --> 00:10:08,720
order to escape by impersonating a
murdered Anbu Black Ops ninja.

140
00:10:08,721 --> 00:10:12,429
Being raised as the
adopted son of the Chief of

141
00:10:12,430 --> 00:10:15,980
the Medical Corps is
a powerful asset of his.

142
00:10:16,779 --> 00:10:20,680
If it turns out that someone as good as
him is working for Orochimaru,

143
00:10:21,049 --> 00:10:22,720
I've got to work harder.

144
00:10:25,259 --> 00:10:29,160
Now, with all of that behind us,
I'd like to begin winding things up.

145
00:10:30,259 --> 00:10:33,171
But before we can bring this
to an end, first there is one

146
00:10:33,172 --> 00:10:36,040
more important matter to
take care of for the final rounds.

147
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:37,440
Let's get on with it!

148
00:10:37,589 --> 00:10:38,340
I mean, come on!

149
00:10:38,380 --> 00:10:40,420
How long do we have to wait until we start
training?

150
00:10:40,640 --> 00:10:43,924
In a calm, orderly fashion,
all of you are going to take

151
00:10:43,925 --> 00:10:46,980
one slip of paper from the
box that Anko is holding.

152
00:10:47,679 --> 00:10:48,996
Everyone just stay where you are.

153
00:10:49,020 --> 00:10:50,020
I'll come to you.

154
00:10:51,005 --> 00:10:52,120
Just take one.

155
00:10:59,740 --> 00:11:00,740
Hmm?

156
00:11:01,420 --> 00:11:01,860
Good.

157
00:11:02,020 --> 00:11:03,060
Now everyone has one.

158
00:11:03,709 --> 00:11:07,180
Going from left to right, tell me the
number that's written on your slip of paper.

159
00:11:07,649 --> 00:11:08,649
I've got eight.

160
00:11:09,744 --> 00:11:10,744
Number one, of course.

161
00:11:11,320 --> 00:11:12,320
Seven.

162
00:11:12,460 --> 00:11:13,460
Five.

163
00:11:13,760 --> 00:11:14,760
Three.

164
00:11:14,900 --> 00:11:15,420
Nine.

165
00:11:15,780 --> 00:11:16,300
Two.

166
00:11:16,680 --> 00:11:17,680
Six.

167
00:11:18,139 --> 00:11:20,260
And that means Sasuke will be number four.

168
00:11:20,860 --> 00:11:21,860
Right.

169
00:11:23,080 --> 00:11:23,880
Very good.

170
00:11:24,020 --> 00:11:28,701
Now I'm going to tell you about how the
final selection tournament is going to work.

171
00:11:29,700 --> 00:11:31,660
Is that what the numbers are for?

172
00:11:31,780 --> 00:11:32,780
Drawing lots?

173
00:11:32,860 --> 00:11:35,820
Eviki, you may reveal which ninja have
been paired up.

174
00:11:35,940 --> 00:11:36,940
Yes, sir.

175
00:11:43,980 --> 00:11:45,440
I'll be waiting forever.

176
00:11:46,020 --> 00:11:47,820
Is that all the final rounds are?

177
00:11:47,900 --> 00:11:48,900
A tournament?

178
00:11:49,320 --> 00:11:51,280
I have to fight an extra round?

179
00:11:51,780 --> 00:11:54,720
I'll probably be expected to avenge
Choji's loss.

180
00:11:56,220 --> 00:11:59,880
Man, I'm glad I'm not in the same half of
the draw as Gaara.

181
00:12:00,840 --> 00:12:02,000
Sasuke Uchiha.

182
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:04,200
Perfect.

183
00:12:05,380 --> 00:12:07,020
I've got Neji Hyuga?

184
00:12:07,380 --> 00:12:08,540
Right off the bat?

185
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:11,300
This couldn't be any better!

186
00:12:12,300 --> 00:12:13,980
May I ask you a question?

187
00:12:14,140 --> 00:12:15,140
You may.

188
00:12:15,220 --> 00:12:15,860
All right.

189
00:12:15,940 --> 00:12:19,620
If this is a tournament, does that mean
there's only going to be one winner?

190
00:12:19,820 --> 00:12:24,200
I mean, only one of us is going to be able
to become a Chunin, then?

191
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:26,500
Actually, it's quite the contrary.

192
00:12:26,900 --> 00:12:30,680
There are going to be several judges for
the final rounds, including myself,

193
00:12:31,020 --> 00:12:35,160
the Shinobi leaders, and the Kazekage,
the lords from the various countries that

194
00:12:35,161 --> 00:12:37,420
ultimately will be assigning your missions
to you.

195
00:12:37,940 --> 00:12:41,280
Through this tournament, these judges will
be able to make a third choice.

196
00:12:41,281 --> 00:12:43,356
They will make a thorough evaluation of
your abilities.

197
00:12:43,380 --> 00:12:45,601
They will then decide
whether any or all of

198
00:12:45,602 --> 00:12:49,081
you possess the qualities
required of a Chunin.

199
00:12:49,260 --> 00:12:54,100
Even if someone loses the first round,
they could still become a Chunin.

200
00:12:54,260 --> 00:12:56,959
So there's actually a chance
that every one of us who

201
00:12:56,960 --> 00:12:59,420
competes in the final
selection could become Chunin?

202
00:12:59,940 --> 00:13:00,500
Correct.

203
00:13:00,680 --> 00:13:04,000
But conversely, there's also a chance that
none of you will be chosen.

204
00:13:04,540 --> 00:13:07,842
The advantage in fighting more
rounds in the tournament is in

205
00:13:07,843 --> 00:13:11,260
getting more chances to
display your talents in front of you.

206
00:13:11,280 --> 00:13:13,316
You are one of the judges who will decide
your fate.

207
00:13:13,340 --> 00:13:15,660
Does that answer your question,
Shikamaru?

208
00:13:16,340 --> 00:13:19,200
This is just about the biggest pain ever.

209
00:13:19,880 --> 00:13:22,060
I thank you all for your patience.

210
00:13:22,300 --> 00:13:24,440
Now let us adjourn until next month.

211
00:13:25,229 --> 00:13:28,160
In the second round, will it be Sasuke or
that browless freak?

212
00:13:28,360 --> 00:13:31,560
He's so strong he took down Bushibrow
without breaking a sweat!

213
00:13:32,760 --> 00:13:35,600
You're one of the ones I want to fight the
most.

214
00:13:35,900 --> 00:13:39,060
I need to ask Kakashi-sensei for help.

215
00:13:42,420 --> 00:13:43,500
Lady Hanabi!

216
00:13:43,660 --> 00:13:44,660
Terrible news!

217
00:13:55,520 --> 00:13:58,700
I heard Elder Sister Hinata was injured.

218
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:01,560
She's been treated and is conscious now.

219
00:14:01,800 --> 00:14:03,060
There's no need to worry.

220
00:14:08,760 --> 00:14:13,300
She should have expected this outcome if
she chose to go up against Neji.

221
00:14:13,980 --> 00:14:16,000
Why didn't you just withdraw?

222
00:14:17,180 --> 00:14:19,760
I couldn't... do that.

223
00:14:21,560 --> 00:14:25,180
I'm quite aware of exactly what I am,
you know?

224
00:14:26,140 --> 00:14:28,080
I'm an indecisive failure.

225
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:30,900
But I don't want to give up.

226
00:14:30,960 --> 00:14:32,580
I want to become strong.

227
00:14:32,581 --> 00:14:35,380
I know that I can change.

228
00:14:36,120 --> 00:14:38,440
Watching Naruto makes me think so.

229
00:14:39,720 --> 00:14:42,120
Naruto... I don't want you here.

230
00:14:42,280 --> 00:14:43,340
You're nothing but a pest!

231
00:14:43,740 --> 00:14:45,600
But I wasn't even doing anything!

232
00:14:46,200 --> 00:14:49,620
I mean, I was just looking at the masks
you have.

233
00:14:53,340 --> 00:14:56,540
I never will go back on my word.

234
00:14:56,860 --> 00:14:59,620
Because that's my ninja way.

235
00:15:04,989 --> 00:15:06,330
Hey, where's Sasuke's room?

236
00:15:06,331 --> 00:15:06,850
Sorry.

237
00:15:07,150 --> 00:15:08,250
No visitors allowed.

238
00:15:08,710 --> 00:15:08,970
What?

239
00:15:09,444 --> 00:15:10,444
No visitors?

240
00:15:10,470 --> 00:15:11,250
Are you kidding me?

241
00:15:11,410 --> 00:15:12,410
Those are the rules.

242
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:14,130
Ah, come on, lady!

243
00:15:14,634 --> 00:15:16,110
Naruto, this is a hospital.

244
00:15:16,130 --> 00:15:17,130
Keep it down.

245
00:15:17,270 --> 00:15:17,450
Huh?

246
00:15:18,009 --> 00:15:19,450
Oh, Kakashi-sensei!

247
00:15:19,570 --> 00:15:21,270
Boy, am I glad to see you!

248
00:15:21,430 --> 00:15:22,810
I gotta ask you a favor!

249
00:15:23,259 --> 00:15:24,150
Stop right there.

250
00:15:24,190 --> 00:15:26,010
I already know what you're going to ask.

251
00:15:26,190 --> 00:15:30,330
So I've been looking for someone that can
oversee your training for the final rounds.

252
00:15:30,710 --> 00:15:31,710
Hold on!

253
00:15:31,909 --> 00:15:33,730
Why can't you train me, sensei?

254
00:15:34,329 --> 00:15:35,950
I have other matters to handle.

255
00:15:36,479 --> 00:15:38,430
I don't have time to deal with you,
Naruto.

256
00:15:38,910 --> 00:15:39,910
Hey!

257
00:15:40,010 --> 00:15:41,010
Aha!

258
00:15:41,370 --> 00:15:44,650
You're going to train Sasuke, aren't you,
Kakashi-sensei?

259
00:15:45,034 --> 00:15:46,430
Now, now, don't complain.

260
00:15:47,139 --> 00:15:50,270
Listen, I've found you an even better
teacher than me.

261
00:15:50,470 --> 00:15:51,810
Well, who is it?

262
00:15:52,050 --> 00:15:53,050
It is I!

263
00:15:56,090 --> 00:15:56,690
You!

264
00:15:56,691 --> 00:15:58,430
You closet pervert!

265
00:16:00,050 --> 00:16:01,250
Such insolence.

266
00:16:01,850 --> 00:16:03,530
What makes you say that?

267
00:16:03,531 --> 00:16:04,670
I'm serious!

268
00:16:04,910 --> 00:16:05,910
You should have seen him!

269
00:16:05,950 --> 00:16:08,590
He saw my harem jutsu once and he fell to
pieces!

270
00:16:10,970 --> 00:16:11,970
Harem jutsu?

271
00:16:12,090 --> 00:16:13,290
Oh, it's nothing.

272
00:16:13,510 --> 00:16:14,890
Just a little joke we shared.

273
00:16:15,930 --> 00:16:17,470
Look, I'll make you a deal.

274
00:16:17,530 --> 00:16:20,310
Keep quiet about that and I'll buy you
anything you want to eat.

275
00:16:20,770 --> 00:16:22,550
Barbecue, ramen, you name it.

276
00:16:22,990 --> 00:16:24,130
Anything I want!

277
00:16:24,810 --> 00:16:25,570
Well, well.

278
00:16:25,810 --> 00:16:28,290
I had no idea you two were acquainted.

279
00:16:29,550 --> 00:16:31,450
Yes, we go way back.

280
00:16:32,570 --> 00:16:35,190
I still don't get why it has to be him.

281
00:16:35,490 --> 00:16:37,610
I mean, anybody else.

282
00:16:37,770 --> 00:16:40,193
Look, you, if it hadn't
been for Kakashi who asked

283
00:16:40,194 --> 00:16:42,730
me this favor, I would
never consider training you.

284
00:16:42,990 --> 00:16:43,290
Yeah?

285
00:16:43,350 --> 00:16:44,190
Well, then don't!

286
00:16:44,270 --> 00:16:46,010
Hey, hey, come on, you two.

287
00:16:46,070 --> 00:16:47,070
Let's calm down.

288
00:16:48,150 --> 00:16:51,330
Listen, Naruto, you're wrong about
Ebisu-sensei.

289
00:16:51,410 --> 00:16:55,830
He's a special Jonin, a private tutor who
only trains the elite.

290
00:16:56,270 --> 00:16:58,410
Frankly, he's a better teacher than I am.

291
00:16:59,290 --> 00:17:00,290
Oh...

292
00:17:02,449 --> 00:17:05,598
Anyway, Naruto, I've got to
say that of the three genin in

293
00:17:05,599 --> 00:17:08,710
Squad 7, you're the one whose
basic skills need the most work.

294
00:17:09,239 --> 00:17:11,750
That's what I want you to focus on this
time around.

295
00:17:12,369 --> 00:17:13,569
Wait, hold on a second!

296
00:17:13,650 --> 00:17:16,849
Are you honestly saying that I'm not as
good as Sasuke or Sakura?!

297
00:17:19,210 --> 00:17:22,948
Naruto, no matter how
many skills you master,

298
00:17:23,008 --> 00:17:25,490
the fundamentals
are, well, fundamental.

299
00:17:25,810 --> 00:17:27,430
And yours could be improved.

300
00:17:27,999 --> 00:17:31,430
So if you really want to become strong,
then just be quiet.

301
00:17:31,450 --> 00:17:32,590
Be quiet and pay attention.

302
00:17:34,239 --> 00:17:35,890
All right, Ebisu-sensei.

303
00:17:35,910 --> 00:17:38,310
I leave him in your capable hands.

304
00:17:38,864 --> 00:17:39,950
I'll do what I can.

305
00:17:43,239 --> 00:17:45,850
I know it seems harsh, but trust me.

306
00:17:46,179 --> 00:17:47,410
It's for your own good.

307
00:17:48,329 --> 00:17:49,530
Just do your best.

308
00:17:52,290 --> 00:17:53,310
Well, come on.

309
00:17:53,679 --> 00:17:54,679
Let's get started.

310
00:18:09,190 --> 00:18:10,190
Watch out!

311
00:18:12,150 --> 00:18:13,210
Jump in, Choji!

312
00:18:13,430 --> 00:18:15,550
Or it's like I'm only fighting Shikamaru!

313
00:18:16,510 --> 00:18:19,150
Yeah, but if I do that, I'm just going to
hurt you, you know?

314
00:18:19,290 --> 00:18:21,010
I'm stronger than you guys think.

315
00:18:21,590 --> 00:18:23,990
Sorry, but I don't want to end up hurting
either one of you.

316
00:18:24,170 --> 00:18:26,190
You really think you can fight better than
us?

317
00:18:26,890 --> 00:18:27,890
Then go ahead!

318
00:18:27,970 --> 00:18:29,050
Just try to hurt us!

319
00:18:29,190 --> 00:18:29,990
Bring it on!

320
00:18:29,991 --> 00:18:31,710
Come on, tough guy!

321
00:18:31,850 --> 00:18:33,270
If you think you're so
strong... Hey, stop that!

322
00:18:33,330 --> 00:18:34,330
You're hurting me!

323
00:18:35,010 --> 00:18:36,010
Damn it.

324
00:18:36,310 --> 00:18:37,730
He's such a drag.

325
00:18:38,810 --> 00:18:39,290
Choji!

326
00:18:39,291 --> 00:18:42,490
Are you being gentle simply because these
two are your friends?

327
00:18:42,870 --> 00:18:44,490
Asuma-sensei, he just...

328
00:18:44,491 --> 00:18:47,210
If that is the case, then you're
completely in the wrong here.

329
00:18:47,550 --> 00:18:51,170
Sparring with a tough partner will only
help to make them stronger, so you'd

330
00:18:51,171 --> 00:18:53,310
actually be doing them a favor by fighting
hard.

331
00:18:53,830 --> 00:18:54,830
Huh?

332
00:18:56,290 --> 00:18:57,670
Don't you understand that?

333
00:18:57,950 --> 00:18:59,450
All right, then I'll show you.

334
00:18:59,530 --> 00:19:00,530
Come on.

335
00:19:01,930 --> 00:19:04,050
You and I are going to spar right now.

336
00:19:04,330 --> 00:19:07,630
And if you're able to strike me even once,
then all of you will pass.

337
00:19:08,030 --> 00:19:11,010
What's more, you have a whole hour to land
that blow.

338
00:19:11,170 --> 00:19:14,102
But if you can't hit me,
Choji, then not only will you be

339
00:19:14,103 --> 00:19:17,770
sent back to the academy,
but Ino and Shikamaru will too.

340
00:19:19,110 --> 00:19:19,550
Seriously?

341
00:19:19,551 --> 00:19:20,551
That's not fair!

342
00:19:21,749 --> 00:19:25,390
Think of me as your enemy, and attack for
your sake as well as theirs.

343
00:19:26,070 --> 00:19:28,450
Transform your kindness into strength.

344
00:19:31,070 --> 00:19:34,430
One plain ramen and one miso ramen with
barbecue pork!

345
00:19:36,150 --> 00:19:37,170
There you go.

346
00:19:38,950 --> 00:19:43,330
Now, Naruto, having had a chance to
observe your technique first hand,

347
00:19:43,470 --> 00:19:46,178
and going off what Kakashi
has told me, it's clear to

348
00:19:46,179 --> 00:19:49,610
me that one of your weakest
points is chakra control.

349
00:19:50,290 --> 00:19:50,790
Hmm?

350
00:19:51,210 --> 00:19:52,270
Chakra control?

351
00:19:52,850 --> 00:19:53,850
Exactly.

352
00:19:53,930 --> 00:19:57,630
When we compare your abilities in this
department with those of your teammates,

353
00:19:57,910 --> 00:19:59,950
Sakura and Sasuke, you're definitely
weaker.

354
00:19:59,951 --> 00:20:07,150
As you may know, in order to successfully
perform ninjutsu, genjutsu, and the like,

355
00:20:07,350 --> 00:20:09,330
a ninja must first build up his chakra.

356
00:20:09,650 --> 00:20:11,110
Yeah, like you said!

357
00:20:11,490 --> 00:20:12,690
I already know that!

358
00:20:13,090 --> 00:20:14,310
I would hope so.

359
00:20:14,710 --> 00:20:18,790
Well then, let's compare you to your
teammates in this department, and perhaps

360
00:20:18,791 --> 00:20:21,750
you'll begin to see just how inferior your
abilities really are.

361
00:20:22,330 --> 00:20:24,670
You've got an annoying way of putting
things.

362
00:20:24,950 --> 00:20:26,990
As agreed, I'm buying you lunch.

363
00:20:27,190 --> 00:20:28,670
So just be quiet and listen.

364
00:20:29,770 --> 00:20:33,630
First, let's examine how Sakura prepares
for a clone jutsu.

365
00:20:34,350 --> 00:20:35,470
Clone jutsu!

366
00:20:39,150 --> 00:20:43,610
She's perfect at building up her chakra to
its full extent, and because she's so

367
00:20:43,611 --> 00:20:47,090
efficient, she can make clones without
wasting any excess energy.

368
00:20:47,970 --> 00:20:49,230
Cha-cha-cha!

369
00:20:49,690 --> 00:20:53,000
As for Sasuke, it must be
said he's not nearly as efficient

370
00:20:53,001 --> 00:20:55,390
when it comes to building
up a full supply of chakra.

371
00:20:57,330 --> 00:20:58,450
Clone jutsu!

372
00:21:02,370 --> 00:21:07,230
But you see, his control over the chakra
itself is so flawless that he has no

373
00:21:07,231 --> 00:21:10,390
problem producing five clones as easily as
Sakura can.

374
00:21:11,010 --> 00:21:15,990
So the result is the same, even if Sasuke
does waste more chakra in getting there.

375
00:21:16,310 --> 00:21:17,030
What do you know?

376
00:21:17,070 --> 00:21:19,150
And I thought Sasuke was perfect in
everything!

377
00:21:19,590 --> 00:21:21,010
Wipe that smile off your face.

378
00:21:21,190 --> 00:21:23,850
You are in no position to make fun of
anyone else.

379
00:21:24,070 --> 00:21:25,070
Why?

380
00:21:26,250 --> 00:21:29,470
You're no good at building up your chakra
or controlling it.

381
00:21:29,530 --> 00:21:33,230
The result being you require much more
chakra to produce any clones.

382
00:21:33,830 --> 00:21:34,850
What the...

383
00:21:35,450 --> 00:21:37,510
You have to exert much more effort.

384
00:21:37,670 --> 00:21:41,790
And even then, after all the effort,
and after wasting much more chakra than

385
00:21:41,791 --> 00:21:44,771
either Sakura or
Sasuke... Clone jutsu!

386
00:21:45,750 --> 00:21:48,770
You can barely produce two clones at best.

387
00:21:49,890 --> 00:21:50,490
Sigh...

388
00:21:50,491 --> 00:21:54,430
In fact, using the same amount of chakra
you use, Sakura can't produce any clones.

389
00:21:54,431 --> 00:21:56,490
Sakura and Sasuke could come up with ten
clones.

390
00:21:57,389 --> 00:21:59,434
Yeah, well if I'm such a
lame-o, how come there have

391
00:21:59,435 --> 00:22:01,350
been times when I've
done better than they have?

392
00:22:01,410 --> 00:22:02,510
That's not the same thing!

393
00:22:02,899 --> 00:22:04,239
That's only because
you have reserves of

394
00:22:04,240 --> 00:22:07,191
energy and stamina that
are hardly even human!

395
00:22:10,674 --> 00:22:14,215
The point is, we both know
you're strong, Naruto, but you

396
00:22:14,216 --> 00:22:16,920
could be so much stronger
if you'd let me show you how.

397
00:22:17,220 --> 00:22:17,640
Really?

398
00:22:17,914 --> 00:22:18,520
You mean it?

399
00:22:18,789 --> 00:22:21,020
I not only mean it, I guarantee it.

400
00:22:21,474 --> 00:22:22,920
Now if you're ready, let's begin.

401
00:22:23,429 --> 00:22:24,800
Sir, your bill.

402
00:22:24,801 --> 00:22:26,740
Oh, I forgot.

403
00:22:31,160 --> 00:22:32,160
Naruto!

404
00:22:35,480 --> 00:22:36,840
Thank you, come again!

405
00:22:46,360 --> 00:22:50,400
Okay, you mind explaining why you've
dragged me up here to these hot springs?

406
00:22:50,700 --> 00:22:52,780
Is a bath part of my training?

407
00:22:52,781 --> 00:22:55,480
Not that I'd mind soaking my feet after
that hike.

408
00:22:55,600 --> 00:22:56,600
Naruto!

409
00:22:56,960 --> 00:22:58,380
Where do you think you're going?

410
00:22:58,640 --> 00:23:00,040
That's the women's bath!

411
00:23:00,320 --> 00:23:03,320
I will not allow any disreputable
behavior, young man!

412
00:23:05,940 --> 00:23:06,800
What is it?

413
00:23:06,920 --> 00:23:07,920
What's that look?

414
00:23:08,020 --> 00:23:09,260
Oh, nothing, nothing.

415
00:23:09,860 --> 00:23:12,400
Anyway, what in the world are we doing
here?

416
00:23:12,580 --> 00:23:15,240
Are you going to train me how to wash
behind my ears?

417
00:23:15,560 --> 00:23:16,340
Not quite.

418
00:23:16,520 --> 00:23:18,840
But you're right, it is part of your
training.

419
00:23:19,340 --> 00:23:20,340
Hmm?

420
00:23:23,520 --> 00:23:24,280
Right here.

421
00:23:24,420 --> 00:23:25,540
This is the place.

422
00:23:25,740 --> 00:23:26,440
A bath?

423
00:23:26,660 --> 00:23:27,960
Okay, what's going on?

424
00:23:28,300 --> 00:23:29,780
Don't take that tone with me.

425
00:23:29,900 --> 00:23:32,580
Like I told you before, this is all part
of your training.

426
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:35,600
Okay, maybe you ought to try taking it
from the top.

427
00:23:35,780 --> 00:23:37,140
What am I training for again?

428
00:23:40,420 --> 00:23:43,660
I'm going to teach you how to walk... on
water.

429
00:23:44,140 --> 00:23:45,140
Huh?

430
00:23:47,360 --> 00:23:48,360
What is it now?

431
00:23:48,840 --> 00:23:54,460
Do you seriously expect me to believe...
that you really know how to walk on water?

432
00:23:54,600 --> 00:23:55,600
Of course I do!

433
00:23:57,460 --> 00:24:01,640
According to what Kakashi told me,
you've already been trained in how to

434
00:24:01,641 --> 00:24:03,580
climb a tree without using your hands,
right?

435
00:24:03,940 --> 00:24:05,580
This is a variation of that.

436
00:24:06,340 --> 00:24:07,340
I don't know.

437
00:24:07,520 --> 00:24:08,920
That was a long time ago.

438
00:24:08,960 --> 00:24:11,500
I'm not so good at remembering stuff that
far back.

439
00:24:12,140 --> 00:24:15,920
Well, in tree climbing, the key is to
build up chakra in the points of contact,

440
00:24:16,140 --> 00:24:18,460
and then to maintain it at a steady rate
of discharge.

441
00:24:18,461 --> 00:24:23,720
Of course, trees are stationary objects,
so the discharge rate remains constant.

442
00:24:24,680 --> 00:24:29,480
All the same, it's an excellent exercise
for developing basic chakra control.

443
00:24:30,160 --> 00:24:33,700
Now, to walk on water, you not only have
to build up chakra at the points of

444
00:24:33,701 --> 00:24:38,260
contact, you must also constantly adjust
the rate of discharge in order to maintain

445
00:24:38,261 --> 00:24:40,340
your balance on the water's shifting
surface.

446
00:24:41,840 --> 00:24:45,840
This is obviously more difficult than just
maintaining a fixed flow of chakra.

447
00:24:46,420 --> 00:24:48,440
But that's what chakra control is all
about.

448
00:24:48,460 --> 00:24:52,400
Being able to discharge it at a steady or
at a varying rate, you understand?

449
00:24:53,740 --> 00:24:55,760
Hmm... I wish I did.

450
00:24:56,040 --> 00:24:59,200
Well, perhaps it would be easier if I just
showed you.

451
00:24:59,820 --> 00:25:03,060
First, build up chakra in the soles of
your feet.

452
00:25:04,020 --> 00:25:07,218
Then, carefully calibrating
the amount you discharge

453
00:25:07,219 --> 00:25:09,900
from each foot in order
to maintain your balance.

454
00:25:13,840 --> 00:25:15,000
There, you see?

455
00:25:15,560 --> 00:25:16,800
That's how it's done!

456
00:25:17,280 --> 00:25:18,280
Cool!

457
00:25:19,360 --> 00:25:21,360
Okay, let me give it a try now!

458
00:25:21,820 --> 00:25:24,220
First, build up chakra in your feet.

459
00:25:25,960 --> 00:25:31,660
And then, calibrating the
whatever it is... Not quite.

460
00:25:34,340 --> 00:25:37,000
Oh, by the way, don't forget it's a hot
spring.

461
00:25:37,240 --> 00:25:39,520
You don't want to keep falling in like
that.

462
00:25:39,700 --> 00:25:41,460
You'll be boiled like a lobster.

463
00:25:41,940 --> 00:25:42,940
Very funny!

464
00:25:44,480 --> 00:25:46,100
I can do this!

465
00:25:51,290 --> 00:25:52,290
Noooo!

466
00:25:54,630 --> 00:25:55,630
Noooo!

467
00:25:57,210 --> 00:25:58,590
Hot hot hot!

468
00:26:00,419 --> 00:26:06,070
Well, you seem unusually diligent today,
Konohamaru.

469
00:26:07,850 --> 00:26:11,810
Excellent, it looks like my guidance is
finally paying off.

470
00:26:12,750 --> 00:26:17,311
Isn't it about time you were launching
another surprise attack against Lord Hokage?

471
00:26:17,510 --> 00:26:19,970
Nah, I don't do that kind of thing
anymore.

472
00:26:19,971 --> 00:26:21,190
That's astounding!

473
00:26:21,430 --> 00:26:23,390
Well, I'm very glad to hear it.

474
00:26:23,430 --> 00:26:27,870
So, you understand that the shortcut to
becoming Hokage is to do exactly as I say.

475
00:26:28,210 --> 00:26:30,250
Well, there aren't any shortcuts here.

476
00:26:30,970 --> 00:26:31,970
Huh?

477
00:26:33,230 --> 00:26:34,510
Naruto told me that.

478
00:26:36,250 --> 00:26:40,530
He said I had to learn that, if I ever
wanted to be Hokage.

479
00:26:45,460 --> 00:26:46,460
Whoa!

480
00:26:48,320 --> 00:26:50,400
I'm actually starting to get this!

481
00:26:51,440 --> 00:26:52,040
Incredible!

482
00:26:52,460 --> 00:26:53,460
He's right!

483
00:26:53,520 --> 00:26:56,420
To think that he's already started to
master it!

484
00:26:56,800 --> 00:26:59,860
I never imagined that he would have come
so far!

485
00:27:00,760 --> 00:27:04,260
Indeed, there are no shortcuts in
anything.

486
00:27:04,980 --> 00:27:08,500
Perhaps you were a better teacher to
Konohamaru than I was.

487
00:27:08,820 --> 00:27:11,360
It seems I was wrong about you,
Naruto.

488
00:27:11,760 --> 00:27:14,400
There is more within you than a demon's
spirit.

489
00:27:15,460 --> 00:27:19,240
There is the heart of a splendid Hidden
Leaf Village ninja.

490
00:27:20,400 --> 00:27:21,400
Ah!

491
00:27:31,020 --> 00:27:34,360
Are you peaking in the women's bath,
old man?

492
00:27:34,780 --> 00:27:37,720
I will not allow any disreputable
behavior!

493
00:27:38,540 --> 00:27:40,580
Oh, please!

494
00:27:42,500 --> 00:27:43,200
Huh?

495
00:27:43,380 --> 00:27:44,420
What on earth?

496
00:27:45,840 --> 00:27:47,280
What are you doing?

497
00:27:57,980 --> 00:27:59,380
What's wrong with you?

498
00:28:00,160 --> 00:28:01,280
Keep it down!

499
00:28:01,600 --> 00:28:03,860
Do you want to get us busted, you idiot?

500
00:28:04,160 --> 00:28:05,160
Huh?

501
00:28:07,320 --> 00:28:08,760
Who is this guy?

502
00:28:08,980 --> 00:28:10,620
He flattened my trainer!

503
00:28:11,100 --> 00:28:14,660
And what's worse, he's an even bigger perv
than Ebisu!

504
00:28:18,800 --> 00:28:19,800
Hehehe!

505
00:28:19,880 --> 00:28:20,880
Hehehe!

